# Build context of every image is the repository root (infra/docker/*.Dockerfile).
# Environment files never enter the context: configuration reaches a container
# at run time - the root `.env` mounted read-only at /repo/.env plus Compose's
# `environment` - not through a layer.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Repository tooling, case files, local data and documents.
.git
.github
.claude
.claude-snapshots
tasks
data
docs
